{"t":"D","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Dominion Energy, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":15200,"hq":"Richmond, VA, United States","website":"https://www.dominionenergy.com","summary_en":"Dominion Energy, Inc. provides regulated electricity and natural gas services in the United States. It operates through Dominion Energy Virginia, Dominion Energy South Carolina, and Contracted Energy segments. The Dominion Energy Virginia segment engages in the generation, distribution, and transmission of electricity to approximately 2.8 million residential, commercial, industrial, and governmental customers in Virginia and North Carolina. The Dominion Energy South Carolina segment generates, transmits, and distributes electricity to approximately 0.8 million customers in the central, southern, and southwestern portions of South Carolina; and distributes natural gas to approximately 0.5 million residential, commercial, and industrial customers in South Carolina. The Contracted Energy segment is involved in the nonregulated long-term contracted renewable electric generation fleet and renewable natural gas facilities. As of December 31, 2025, the company's portfolio of assets included approximately 30.7 GW of electric generating capacity, 10,800 miles of electric transmission lines, and 80,400 miles of electric distribution lines. The company was formerly known as Dominion Resources, Inc. Dominion Energy, Inc. was incorporated in 1983 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Dominion Energy, Inc.는 미국에서 규제된 전기 및 천연가스 서비스를 제공합니다. Dominion Energy Virginia, Dominion Energy South Carolina 및 Contracted Energy 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. Dominion Energy Virginia 부문은 버지니아와 노스캐롤라이나에 있는 약 280만 명의 주거용, 상업, 산업 및 정부 고객을 대상으로 전력을 생산, 배전 및 송전하는 업무를 담당합니다. Dominion Energy South Carolina 부문은 사우스캐롤라이나 중부, 남부 및 남서부 지역의 약 80만 고객에게 전기를 생성, 송전 및 분배합니다. 사우스캐롤라이나에 있는 약 50만 명의 주거용, 상업용, 산업용 고객에게 천연가스를 공급합니다. 계약 에너지 부문은 규제되지 않은 장기 계약 재생 가능 발전 시설 및 재생 가능 천연 가스 시설과 관련되어 있습니다. 2025년 12월 31일 현재 회사의 자산 포트폴리오에는 약 30.7GW의 발전 용량, 10,800마일의 송전선, 80,400마일의 배전선이 포함되어 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Dominion Resources, Inc.로 알려져 있었습니다. Dominion Energy, Inc.는 1983년에 설립되었으며 버지니아주 리치몬드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":68.24,"mcap":60021587968.0,"pe":22.521452,"fpe":17.867569,"peg":2.6664,"ps":3.1246595,"pb":2.1024091,"ev_ebitda":13.671,"div":3.89,"beta":0.59,"hi52":72.99,"lo52":55.85},"fin":{"rev":19209000960.0,"rev_g":0.241,"eps_g":0.12,"gross":0.46508998,"op":0.35072,"net":0.13993,"roe":0.08821,"fcf":-7814249984.0,"cash":435000000.0,"debt":55600001024.0,"de":161.557,"eps":3.03,"feps":3.81921},"own":{"short":0.0272,"inst":0.84287,"insider":0.00135},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":70.16667,"median":68.0,"high":87.0,"low":62.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.5625,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":3,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":2,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":68.0,"priorPriceTarget":70.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Mizuho","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":67.0,"priorPriceTarget":72.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":65.0,"priorPriceTarget":69.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":62.0,"priorPriceTarget":66.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-18","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equ